      "concept": "Malkavian Primogen (by habit)",
      "chronicle": "The Ward File",
      "ambition": "To decipher what the city is trying to tell him.",
      "desire": "",
      "touchstones": "<h3>Convictions</h3><ul><li>Never interrupt someone who is telling the truth</li></ul><h3>Touchstones</h3><ul><li><strong>Helen Ward (PNJ-04)</strong>: Though she doesn&#39;t know it.</li></ul>",
      "sire": "A nameless Malkavian who used to call in from Fremont",
