      "history": ""
    },
    "biography": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.AeAhHuCNHL9KWVnT]{Profile: Wendell Fry}</p><blockquote><p><em>“You&#39;re not crazy, Helen. And the rain has ears.”</em></p></blockquote><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Epithet</th><td>The Three A.M. Voice</td></tr><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Malkavian Primogen (by habit)</td></tr><tr><th>Clan</th><td>Malkavian</td></tr><tr><th>Sect</th><td>Camarilla</td></tr><tr><th>Sire</th><td>A nameless Malkavian who used to call in from Fremont</td></tr><tr><th>Born</th><td>1938</td></tr><tr><th>Embraced</th><td>1971</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>To decipher what the city is trying to tell him.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Looks about thirty-three. Thin, a scruffy beard, thick-framed glasses, corduroy, and a cap from a team that no longer exists; headphones around his neck and a radio voice.</p>",
    "appearance": "<p>Looks about thirty-three. Thin, a scruffy beard, thick-framed glasses, corduroy, and a cap from a team that no longer exists; headphones around his neck and a radio voice.</p>",
    "equipment": "",
    "notes": "",
    "privatenotes": "<p>Editor&#39;s Note: doc 06 said “looks about fifty-five” and “white beard”; the decision was to use his age at the Embrace (about 33, no gray in his beard). Doc 06 gave him “Mask 1 (eccentric Fremont retiree)”; the decision was that his Mask is a late-night host at a community radio station.</p>",
